       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. PANGRAM.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
         01 WS-SENTENCE PIC X(60).
         01 WS-RESULT PIC 99.
         01 WS-LOOPCNT PIC 99 VALUE 1.
         01 WS-CHARCNT PIC 9(2).
         01 WS-ALPHABET-ARRAY.
           05 WS-CHAR PIC A OCCURS 26 TIMES INDEXED BY I.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       PANGRAM.
         MOVE 1 TO WS-LOOPCNT.
         MOVE 1 TO WS-RESULT.
         MOVE "abcdefghijklnmopqrstuvwxyz" TO WS-ALPHABET-ARRAY.
         PERFORM CHECK-FOR-ALPHABET WITH TEST AFTER UNTIL WS-LOOPCNT > 25.

       CHECK-FOR-ALPHABET.
        INSPECT FUNCTION LOWER-CASE(WS-SENTENCE) TALLYING WS-CHARCNT FOR ALL WS-CHAR(WS-LOOPCNT).
        IF WS-CHARCNT < 1 THEN
          MOVE 0 TO WS-RESULT
        END-IF.
        SET WS-CHARCNT TO 0.
        ADD 1 TO WS-LOOPCNT.